{"time": 1769174613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1103905666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那么你们注意到还有一个鬼鬼祟祟的影子，不过看起来只是一个普通的中年妇女，在看着这所疗养院和你们"}
{"time": 1769174650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1265657918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“我说，刚才我们在大战虚体的时候，你有在看着罢”"}
{"time": 1769174684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2040662714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....嗯...”她点了点头"}
{"time": 1769174684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "466652515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“if you want it”"}
{"time": 1769174697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1323477334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“then you have to take it”"}
{"time": 1769174730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1093972847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啊？”她疑惑的看着起司伯格"}
{"time": 1769174738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1753751567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“你是？”"}
{"time": 1769174740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2078555212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "576021174"}, "sender": {"id": "576021174", "name": "益承"}, "message": "“你是？”"}
{"time": 1769174747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1427650932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“算了，小姐是这边员工……呃，前员工吗？”"}
{"time": 1769174768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "420652652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我..对了，抱歉，刚刚被那个鬼魂吓到了，我叫慕拉，住在镇上的酒馆上”"}
{"time": 1769174803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "162638590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“因爲這裡的新老闆承諾會給予好的照顧，我們才將父親送到這裡的。在剛開始，所有一切都是乾淨而明亮的，父親非常高興。但之後員工就拒絕一切訪問者。不再提供合適的食物，只有稀粥和清水。父親雖老但不衰弱。可是在住進療養院後不久父親就去世了。”\n她抬起頭用充滿淚水的眼睛望著大家，“如果你們也有愛人在內，趕快接出來吧。不要讓他們在這裡受罪到死。”"}
{"time": 1769174817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1438832112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“行”"}
{"time": 1769174841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1394161941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎卧槽这老板怎么这么坏”"}
{"time": 1769174917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2097484848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "576021174"}, "sender": {"id": "576021174", "name": "益承"}, "message": "“行，当个事办”"}
{"time": 1769174957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1199757692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那老板在哪呢，让我看看”"}
{"time": 1769174961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2064132238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "576021174"}, "sender": {"id": "576021174", "name": "益承"}, "message": "“很抱歉听到你父亲的消息。那么请问你现在在这里做什么呢？”"}
{"time": 1769175023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "75157825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我父亲的尸体还在疗养院内...他们一直不让我进去..所以我只能在附近等，我看几位各个都是人才，可以帮我进去看看发生了什么吗”"}
{"time": 1769175080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1376106489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好啊，我们就是来踢门的。受人之托，忠人之事”"}
{"time": 1769175139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877959608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“刚刚那个鬼！”"}
{"time": 1769175140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "576823902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“拜托你们了”随后她便继续找个角落观望了"}
{"time": 1769175148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "239927955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你知道是什么来头吗”"}
{"time": 1769175209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1425009855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我还听说吧，那个人叫桑巴，她和他丈夫来希望谷做生意，结果她和家乡的供应商切断了供应协议”"}
{"time": 1769175224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898603391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“结果留下来很多的债务，她丈夫被债主杀死了”"}
{"time": 1769175238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "947587413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“在那之后她觉得都是自己的错，就想饿死自己”"}
{"time": 1769175242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084346160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那我们跟她应该是一伙的”"}
{"time": 1769175246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "439356805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“为什么要攻击我们”"}
{"time": 1769175249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864280699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“然后她就变成了鬼”"}
{"time": 1769175299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "474344135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了，几位好汉，我就不打扰你们了”"}
{"time": 1769175338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "911030756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“事已至此”"}
{"time": 1769175362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167872941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“打碉楼，杀四郎！”"}
{"time": 1769175391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946368501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*开门大吉！"}
{"time": 1769175491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749004640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "前門後面是一段淺淺的門廳，它是顯得如此冰冷而陰暗，沒有什麽光源。大的會客區域中，幾個桌子凄凉地擺在地上，沒有一個病人或訪客。兩間靠邊的辦公室上露出小小的窗——大廳中唯一的光線來自於從外窗照射進的日光。"}
{"time": 1769175522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1854781076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不知道的还以为这是地牢”"}
{"time": 1769175539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1178565535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“太邪恶了”*巡视"}
{"time": 1769175548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697911975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "*进入隐身状态，示意队友用法师之手开门"}
{"time": 1769175610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "945292858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*进i3！"}
{"time": 1769175616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "419131804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "i3的门锁了"}
{"time": 1769175630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1566126646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+6"}
{"time": 1769175630, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1566126646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[艾利欧]演奏出: 1D20+6={7}+6=13"}
{"time": 1769175639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "612338793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "未打开"}
{"time": 1769175707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "7732547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "主辦公室兩條桌子雜亂的放著，架子上放滿了碎紙、羽毛筆和墨水瓶。兩個中年管理者，一男一女，相互看著，驚訝訪客的到來。男人就這麽站著，眼睛盯著眼鏡下的鼻子，什麽都不說。"}
{"time": 1769175737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "302216631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "576021174"}, "sender": {"id": "576021174", "name": "益承"}, "message": "“啊？有人？”"}
{"time": 1769175752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "403784685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你要干嘛，不开放来访”女的生气的看着"}
{"time": 1769175758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1936990381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说出汝名，吓我一跳？”"}
{"time": 1769175759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878969621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "（要"}
{"time": 1769175760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "192975242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "骑冲的家伙"}
{"time": 1769175767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458223695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我看你是，搞不明白状况”"}
{"time": 1769175780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "223426456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？脑残”"}
{"time": 1769175789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "653972691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她是芊羽？）"}
{"time": 1769175806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1621667235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(可能是"}
{"time": 1769175828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648189951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谁跟你嘻嘻哈哈，你们这开在沟槽的疗养院，我看也该走到头了”"}
{"time": 1769175869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68363082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你们是给谁打工的，自己说还是等我的关羽之歌把你们咬的半死再说”"}
{"time": 1769175887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948592483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？哼，听不懂人话是吧”两位管理人员拔出了刀“寿司吧”"}
{"time": 1769175890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682227535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“二者何人，报上名来”"}
{"time": 1769175892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1927767802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "728048958", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".init clear"}
